    <briefdescription>
<para>Routines for date and time manipulation and conversion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This group contains subroutines and functions for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Computing time differences between dates</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Generating new dates from time increments</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Converting between date formats</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Julian day calculations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Date string parsing and manipulation </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
